.SH Name
str2i
\-
convert a string to an integer
.
.
.SH Library
String-to-integer library
.RI ( liba2i ", " \-la2i )
.
.
.SH Synopsis
.nf
.B include <a2i/str2i/str2i.h>
.fi
.P
.B int
.SY str2i (
.B TYPE,
.BI TYPE\~*restrict\~ n ,
.BI const\~char\~* s );
.YS
.
.
.SH Description
This macro is like
.MR str2s 3
and
.MR str2u 3 ,
but works with all integer types.
.
